OL,3,GNEWSAApprentice Boys banned from
OL,4,Amarching along lower Ormeau Road
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said allowing the march to proceed
OL,7,Falong the proposed route would cause
OL,8,Fsignificant disruption to the local
OL,9,Fcommunity, with the potential for
OL,10,Fdisorder and harm to community
OL,11,Frelations.
